# Requests for any of the 7 apps.
# VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each one.
# Change the port to switch app:
# 4000 Express · 4001 Fastify · 4002 NestJS · 4003 FastAPI · 4004 Django · 4005 Laravel · 4006 ASP.NET Core

@base = http://localhost:4000
@token = secret123

### Hello
GET {{base}}/

### List books
GET {{base}}/books

### Filter by author (query string)
GET {{base}}/books?author=martin

### One book (URL param)
GET {{base}}/books/1

### Missing book -> 404
GET {{base}}/books/999

### Unknown route -> 404
GET {{base}}/nope

### Create without a token -> 401
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Refactoring", "author": "Martin Fowler" }

### Create with invalid data -> 400 or 422
POST {{base}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "title": "", "year": 5000 }

### Create -> 201
POST {{base}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "title": "Refactoring", "author": "Martin Fowler", "year": 1999 }

### Update -> 200
PUT {{base}}/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "title": "Clean Code (2nd ed.)", "author": "Robert C. Martin", "year": 2025 }

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/books/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
